            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/members/:id",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "Lightfield-Version",
                "value": "2026-03-01"
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "id",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Retrieves a single member by their ID.\n\n**[Required scope](/using-the-api/scopes/):** `members:read`\n\n**[Rate limit category](/using-the-api/rate-limits/):** Read"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "List members",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/members",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "Lightfield-Version",
                "value": "2026-03-01"
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "offset",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query"
              },
              {
                "name": "limit",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Returns a paginated list of members in your workspace. Use `offset` and `limit` to paginate through results. See <u>[List endpoints](/using-the-api/list-endpoints/)</u> for more information about pagination.\n\n**[Required scope](/using-the-api/scopes/):** `members:read`\n\n**[Rate limit category](/using-the-api/rate-limits/):** Search"
